oauth.description:
Reading the account balance requires a signed-in session. This integration uses the official Towngas WeChat authorization and never stores your password.

1. Scan the QR code below with **WeChat on your phone** (opening it in a desktop browser is blocked by WeChat);
2. After authorizing, the page redirects to `{oauth_redirect}`;
3. Copy the **authCode** value from the redirect URL and paste it in the next step.

{oauth_qr_markdown}

If the QR code does not render, open this URL with WeChat on your phone:
`{oauth_url}`

account.description:
The subscriber number is the last part of the billing URL, for example 1700075442 in .../ZS0105/**1700075442**.

The authCode is the value after `authCode=` in the redirect URL and is valid for about 5 minutes.

{error_detail}
